  "2026-09-07T10:08:37.538Z",pi-agent,"All quality gates pass: check, docstring, coverage (100/100/100), verify:release-publish-attestation, test (188/188). BEFORE: 11 wrong. AFTER: clean (0 wrong)."
close_reason: "Convergence complete. Scanner deleted, verifier is thin launcher over pm-ops/attestation, tests rewritten as consumer tests with main-invocation coverage. All gates pass at 100/100/100. check.sh: 11 wrong -> clean."
